          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Suppose a singly linked list of integers is given below: (head) 7  11  6  4  3  12  8  2 (tail) What does the list look like after the following java code snippet is run?</p><pre><code>int x = <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">f</span> = head;\nwhile(f.next !=  tail) f = f.next;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">q</span> = new <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">Node</span><span class=\"hljs-title\">(x</span>);\nq.next = tail;\nf.next = q;</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Giả sử một danh sách liên kết đơn các số nguyên như bên dưới: (head) 7  11  6  4  3  12  8  2 (tail) Danh sách sẽ như thế nào sau khi đoạn mã Java sau chạy?</p><pre><code>int x = <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">f</span> = head;\nwhile(f.next !=  tail) f = f.next;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">q</span> = new <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">Node</span><span class=\"hljs-title\">(x</span>);\nq.next = tail;\nf.next = q;</code></pre></div>",
